FORM S-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: statutes-of-strings.
FILED BY: the legislature, in triplicate, each copy the reverse of the last.

OFF THE RECORD: The statutes of strings. Positions are 1-indexed and
OFF THE RECORD: measured in characters (code points), as everywhere
OFF THE RECORD: in this jurisdiction; lawyers count from one.

THE OFFICE OF repetition, CONCERNING text AND count.
    SHOULD count FAIL TO EXCEED 0, REMAND WITH "".
    REMAND WITH text PLUS (THE FINDING OF repetition REGARDING text AND count LESS 1).

THE OFFICE OF reversal, CONCERNING text.
    SHOULD THE LENGTH OF text FAIL TO EXCEED 1, REMAND WITH text.
    REMAND WITH (AN EXCERPT OF text FROM THE LENGTH OF text TO THE LENGTH OF text) PLUS (THE FINDING OF reversal REGARDING AN EXCERPT OF text FROM 1 TO (THE LENGTH OF text) LESS 1).

OFF THE RECORD: containment: SUSTAINED when the fragment appears in
OFF THE RECORD: the document. The empty fragment appears in every
OFF THE RECORD: document, including the empty one; the Court has
OFF THE RECORD: reviewed the philosophy and declines to reopen it.

THE OFFICE OF containment, CONCERNING document AND fragment.
    SHOULD THE LENGTH OF fragment EQUAL 0, REMAND WITH SUSTAINED.
    SHOULD THE FINDING OF position-of REGARDING document AND fragment EXCEED 0, REMAND WITH SUSTAINED.
    REMAND WITH OVERRULED.

OFF THE RECORD: position-of: the position of the first appearance of
OFF THE RECORD: the fragment, or 0 when it does not appear (there is
OFF THE RECORD: no position 0; lawyers count from one, so 0 is the
OFF THE RECORD: courthouse basement, where nothing is ever found).

THE OFFICE OF position-of, CONCERNING document AND fragment.
    SHOULD THE LENGTH OF fragment EQUAL 0, REMAND WITH 0.
    REMAND WITH THE FINDING OF position-from REGARDING document AND fragment AND 1.

THE OFFICE OF position-from, CONCERNING document AND fragment AND index.
    SHOULD index PLUS (THE LENGTH OF fragment) LESS 1 EXCEED THE LENGTH OF document, REMAND WITH 0.
    SHOULD (AN EXCERPT OF document FROM index TO index PLUS (THE LENGTH OF fragment) LESS 1) EQUAL fragment, REMAND WITH index.
    REMAND WITH THE FINDING OF position-from REGARDING document AND fragment AND index PLUS 1.
